767c971c\",\"fence\":1,\"spec_rev\":1,\"commit\":\"<FULL_COMMIT_SHA>\"}\nGit 写操作：把执行工具的工作目录设为本 attempt 的 worktree。git add <路径> 和 git commit … 必须各自作为一条独立的工具命令执行；不要与 cd、检查命令或彼此用 &&、分号、管道、换行、变量赋值或重定向拼接。git status、git diff、测试和 git rev-parse 另行执行。两条 Git 前缀 allow 规则只授权对应命令；若独立执行仍被沙箱拒绝，上报问题并结束，不重试或修改权限。\n完成并 Git 提交后，把 FULL_COMMIT_SHA 换成完整提交号，运行以下 CLI 显式交付：\n'/opt/homebrew/Cellar/node/26.5.0/bin/node' '/private/tmp/t81-6e-rest-_tj6f8_v/candidate/workbench/src/gates/cli.ts' '--state' '/private/tmp/q76-ivun6xlt/c-75ij84v9/state' 'submit' '--task' 'fixture-20261015-1' '--attempt' 'f487a563-96ac-4bc8-ab72-e04283ed6161' '--session' '380f7e0e-e1ef-48da-a774-5243767c971c' '--fence' '1' '--spec-rev' '1' '--commit' 'FULL_COMMIT_SHA'\n本会话的 CLI 会将 submit、status、issue 请求写到 A2A_REQUEST_DIR 指向的本 attempt 专用 /tmp 目录；不直接连接 socket。queued=true 只表示已排队，不是门禁通过。最后结束回合，让 Stop hook 读取并转交；没有请求文件就不交付。请求文件不得进入 Git 提交。查状态用同一入口 status --task，问题上报用 issue --task --title --body。不要修改合同、验收程序或沙箱权限。"}},{"seq":27,"time":"2026-10-15T09:25:36.506Z","task":"fixture-20261015-1","attempt":"f487a563-96ac-4bc8-ab72-e04283ed6161","type":"dispatched","details":{"attempt":{"task_id":"fixture-20261015-1","attempt_id":"f487a563-96ac-4bc8-ab72-e04283ed6161","session_id":"380f7e0e-e1ef-48da-a774-5243767c971c","fence":1,"spec_rev":1,"thread_id":"ab125f37-0aaf-4292-ae02-ad59e3c04a3b","runtime_mode":"workspace-write","turn_id":null,"runtime_identity":{"launch":"60df4f44-897e-490c-9697-ab3921754bfc","thread":"ab125f37-0aaf-4292-ae02-ad59e3c04a3b","shell_pid":31000,"leader_pid":31001,"native_session":"fixture-native-60df4f44-897e-490c-9697-ab3921754bfc"},"workspace":"/private/tmp/q76-ivun6xlt/c-75ij84v9/state/worktrees/fixture/fixture-20261015-1-a1","base_commit":"21439619e807e1a7435085569b610d6f8308cdee","card_snapshot_id":"2b7d0d9f-6e3b-4ee9-8143-6b86d8a67bf3","reclaimed":false,"owner":"fixture-20261015-1","state":"claimed"}}},{"seq":28,"time":"2026-10-15T09:25:37.566Z","task":"fixture-20261015-1","attempt":"f487a563-96ac-4bc8-